  "body": "https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/86022424b865fa50ade8a90825b47a0012a16ae0/#add-an-event-listener\r\n\r\n> If _listener_’s passive is null, then set it to the default passive value given _type_ and _eventTarget_.\r\n\r\nThis is a very minor issue, but it also looks very easy to fix. Step 4 of the algorithm to add an event listener refers to a variable called _type_, but that variable doesn't exist. Unless I've missed something, this is supposed to say \"_listener_'s type\".",
